      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon. From what you've told me, this looks most like hip osteoarthritis. I wanna be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out a back problem yet. Let's get an X-ray of the hips, for hip pain. The treatment will be naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day with food, two weeks. It's for hip pain."
